B.a2Q=new A.dM("Type what the receipt shows, top to bottom. The app works out the tax and the total; you only enter the parts.",null)
B.a36=new A.dM("Receipt: the amounts you type are before tax, and tax is added at the rate for each category and the place you shopped.",null)
B.a31=new A.dM("Bank: the amounts come off a statement, with the tax already inside them, so nothing is added. The choice stays put between expenses, for working through a statement.",null)
B.Nj=s([B.a36,B.a31],t.p)
B.a3o=new A.ji("From",B.Nj,null)
B.a2T=new A.dM("The date starts as today, already selected, so you can type over it. Pick the store from the list, or tap one of the recent stores under the field.",null)
B.M8=s([B.a2T],t.p)
B.a3t=new A.ji("Date and store",B.M8,null)
B.a2V=new A.dM("Pick the main category: the one most of the receipt is, like Groceries. The list puts the categories you use most at this store first, then the ones you use most anywhere.",null)
B.a37=new A.dM("Type the subtotal printed on the receipt, before tax. If the whole receipt is one category, that is all: two entries, however long the receipt.",null)
B.a2N=new A.dM("With Gas, Car Payment or Tithing as the main category, there are no other categories: the amount you type is the whole expense.",null)
B.Mz=s([B.a2V,B.a37,B.a2N],t.p)
B.a3u=new A.ji("Receipt subtotal and main category",B.Mz,null)
B.a2R=new A.dM("Everything on the receipt that is not the main category goes here. Each item you enter is taken out of the subtotal, and the main category gets what is left, so you never add anything up.",null)
B.a32=new A.dM("Choose the category from its list, the same way as the main category: start typing its name and press Enter once it is the only one that matches, or use the arrow keys. Then type how many lines of the receipt are in it and press Enter: that many boxes appear on the same line, Item 1, Item 2 and so on.",null)
B.a2S=new A.dM("Type each price before tax and press Enter to move to the next. Their total shows underneath. If you counted one short, Add item makes another box.",null)
B.a2W=new A.dM("Rebates and instant savings, like Costco's, are lines of their own on the receipt, so count them as items and type them with a minus: -3.00. A rebate on a main-category item needs nothing typed, because the subtotal already includes it.",null)
B.a34=new A.dM("After the last item, the cursor goes to the next category. Press Enter there without choosing one when you have no more, or Shift+Enter in any item, and you are on to the note. Backspace on an empty category removes it.",null)
B.Lx=s([B.a2R,B.a32,B.a2S,B.a2W,B.a34],t.p)
B.a3p=new A.ji("Other categories",B.Lx,null)
B.a2U=new A.dM("Under the lines, each category shows its amount before tax, its tax and its total, with the whole receipt's total last. Compare that total with the receipt: if they differ, a price was missed or mistyped.",null)
B.LG=s([B.a2U],t.p)
B.a3m=new A.ji("Totals",B.LG,null)
B.a33=new A.dM("Amounts fill from the cents up, like a till: typing 1, 5, 0 gives 1.50. There is no need to type the decimal point. A minus sign makes a refund.",null)
B.My=s([B.a33],t.p)
B.a3q=new A.ji("Typing amounts",B.My,null)
B.a35=new A.dM("Where you shopped, which decides the sales-tax rate. It starts as the store's usual place, or your home. Start typing a city to choose another.",null)
B.M5=s([B.a35],t.p)
B.a3n=new A.ji("Location",B.M5,null)
B.a2X=new A.dM('Save expense shows the receipt as it will be stored, under "Does this match your receipt?". If an amount or the tax differs from the paper, correct it there: the receipt wins.',null)
B.a30=new A.dM("Save & New files it and clears the form for the next receipt. Save & Home files it and goes back to the home screen. Back returns to the form without saving.",null)
B.a2P=new A.dM("If something would stop the expense from saving, it is said beside the Save expense button while you type.",null)
B.LW=s([B.a2X,B.a30,B.a2P],t.p)
B.a3r=new A.ji("Saving",B.LW,null)
B.a2O=new A.dM("Everything works without a mouse. Enter moves to the next field in the order a receipt is read: date, store, subtotal, main category, then each other category, its item count and its items, and finally the note.",null)
B.a2Z=new A.dM("Enter in the note moves to Save expense, which shows a ring around it. Press Enter again to save. The check that follows opens with Save & New selected, so one more Enter files the expense and puts you back on the date of a fresh form.",null)
B.a2Y=new A.dM("Tab and Shift+Tab move between fields and buttons, including the corrections in the check. Space or Enter presses a selected button. F1 opens this page.",null)
B.a3_=new A.dM("Hold Shift and use the arrow keys to jump to the nearest field in that direction: Shift+Up from the store goes back to the date, and Shift+Down from the subtotal goes to the main category and then the other categories.",null)
B.Nu=s([B.a2O,B.a2Z,B.a2Y,B.a3_],t.p)
B.a3s=new A.ji("Keyboard",B.Nu,null)
